-        $\lambda_{N}\!\downarrow\!0$, $N\lambda_{N}\!\uparrow\!\infty$,
-        and a curvature weight $\gamma_{N}$ satisfies
-        $\gamma_{N}\!\downarrow\!0$ with $\gamma_{N}/\lambda_{N}=O(1)$.
